  nodes:
  - id: bark_1
    speakerName: Panicked Vendor
    speakerPortrait: {fileID: 0}
    text: If dark sorcery can melt through Master Ignatius' Dwarven vault, what's stopping them from burning down the entire bazaar?! The Guild Council does nothing!
    registersClue: {fileID: 0}
    setsFlag: 
    requiresFlag: 
    options: []
    nextNodeId: bark_2
  - id: bark_2
    speakerName: Apothecary Apprentice
    speakerPortrait: {fileID: 0}
    text: The purple smoke stayed in the alley for an hour. It stung my eyes, but... didn't smell like sulfur. Smelled like vinegar and lamp oil.
    registersClue: {fileID: 0}
    setsFlag: 
    requiresFlag: 
    options: []
    nextNodeId: bark_3
  - id: bark_3
    speakerName: City Bailiff
    speakerPortrait: {fileID: 0}
    text: Move along! The Alchemist Guildhall is sealed by order of Magistrate Corvo. No trade until the contamination team clears the street.
    registersClue: {fileID: 0}
